This repository contains scripts and measurements. The quantized model itself is
published separately at https://huggingface.co/CYBERS3C/AMALIA-9B-0626-DPO-FP8 and
derives from amalia-llm/AMALIA-9B-0626-DPO, also Apache 2.0. All credit for the
model belongs to the AMALIA team.
